+    """Run inside the existing compaction write transaction after row insertion.
+
+    The current producer receipt is passed independently of message metadata. A
+    carried old receipt or user-supplied dict cannot substitute for its identity.
+    Generic insert/append/import paths do not pass this admission argument.
+    """
